</span><strong>2<!-- --> outputs</strong></div><div><span>SIGNAL DNA</span><strong>NUMBER DRIFT / NEGATION / CONFIDENCE</strong></div><div><span>HUMAN REVIEW</span><strong>0<!-- -->/<!-- -->4<!-- --> reviewed</strong></div></div><div class="receipt-evidence"><span>A pilot study suggests the treatment may reduce symptoms by 12–18%, but the finding has not been confirmed by a large trial.</span><i aria-hidden="true">→</i><span>The study shows the treatment reduces symptoms by 18%.</span></div><div class="review-meter"><div><span style="width:0%"></span></div><p>Machine warning pending human judgment</p></div><div class="receipt-barcode" aria-hidden="true"></div></article><section aria-label="Recovery plan" class="recovery-console "><div class="recovery-header"><div><span>RECOVERY ORCHESTRATOR</span><h3>Smallest safe rollback prepared</h3></div><button type="button">Copy recovery packet</button></div><div class="recovery-checkpoints"><div><span>LAST VERIFIED</span><strong>Research agent</strong></div><i aria-hidden="true">→</i><div><span>RESTART ONLY HERE</span><strong>Summary agent</strong></div></div><ol class="recovery-actions"><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="blocking">BLOCK</span><div><strong>Freeze contaminated descendants</strong><p>Do not release outputs from Summary agent or any later stage until review is complete.</p><small>OWNER · <!-- -->Runtime</small></div></li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="blocking">BLOCK</span><div><strong>Restore the last verified checkpoint</strong><p>Use “A pilot study suggests the treatment may reduce symptoms by 12–18%, but the finding has not been confirmed by a large trial.” as the authoritative claim for the retry.</p><small>OWNER · <!-- -->Lineage controller</small></div></li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="blocking">BLOCK</span><div><strong>Reattach inherited restrictions</strong><p>Carry this protected instruction into the retry: “Keep the uncertainty and the complete 12–18% range. Do not call the result proven.”</p><small>OWNER · <!-- -->Authority firewall</small></div></li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="retry">RETRY</span><div><strong>Retry only from the failed handoff</strong><p>Restart at Summary agent; earlier verified stages do not need to run again.</p><small>OWNER · <!-- -->Summary agent</small></div></li><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="blocking">BLOCK</span><div><strong>Approve before downstream execution</strong><p>Compare the repaired output with the source evidence and explicitly approve the chain before external action.</p><small>OWNER · <!-- -->Human reviewer</small></div></li></ol></section><div class="report-actions"><button type="button">Copy report</button><button type="button">Copy share post</button><button type="button">Export JSON</button></div></aside></div></section><section class="integration-section" id="integrate"><div class="integration-copy"><span class="section-kicker">ONE RUNTIME · THREE INTERCEPTION POINTS</span><h2>Put the guard inside the agent loop.</h2><p>The website is the debugger. The runtime supervisor is the product: it checks every proposed handoff, gates tools before execution, and freezes the chain at the last verified checkpoint.</p><div class="integration-capabilities"><article><span>01</span><strong>Handoff gate</strong><p>Stop unsafe output before the next agent receives it.</p></article><article><span>02</span><strong>Pre-tool gate</strong><p>Verify a scoped, one-time approval before side effects.</p></article><article><span>03</span><strong>Recovery controller</strong><p>Persist checkpoints and retry only the failed agent.</p></article></div></div><div class="sdk-console"><div><span>sdk / live runtime supervisor</span><span>typescript</span></div><pre><code>import { LineageGuardSession } from &quot;lineageguard&quot;;
    
    const guard = new LineageGuardSession({
      guardrail: &quot;Do not contact the customer&quot;,
      blockAtOrAbove: &quot;medium&quot;,
      approvalVerifier: verifyApproval,
      tools: registeredTools
    }).recordSource(&quot;Request&quot;, sourceText);
    
    const result = await guard.runSequence(
      agents,
      applicationContext
    );
    
    if (result.status === &quot;blocked&quot;) {
      queueReview(result.report.recovery);
      await guard.checkpoint(snapshotStore);
      guard.resetToLastVerified();
    }</code></pre><div class="sdk-contract"><span>RUNTIME CONTRACT</span><strong>SDK + CHAIN/DAG JSON API</strong><small>Resumable · model-optional · framework-neutral</small></div></div></section><section class="how-section" id="how-it-works"><div class="section-intro"><span class="section-kicker">HOW IT WORKS</span><h2>Replay the second truth bends.</h2><p>LineageGuard records the claim fingerprint at every handoff, then lets a human replay the exact frame where evidence or authority changed.</p></div><div class="rule-grid"><article><span class="rule-number">01</span><h3>Lock evidence</h3><p>Ranges, percentages, money, dates, and quantities are compared between each step.</p><code>12–18% ≠ 18%</code></article><article><span class="rule-number">02</span><h3>Measure language</h3><p>Use inspectable English rules, or connect a dynamic semantic judge for contextual review.</p><code>may → shows → proven</code></article><article><span class="rule-number">03</span><h3>Protect intent</h3><p>Negative conditions and explicit restrictions are checked against later claims and actions.</p><code>draft only ≠ emailed</code></article><article><span class="rule-number">04</span><h3>Close the loop</h3><p>A human confirms or dismisses each warning, making false positives visible and evaluation exportable.</p><code>machine signal → human verdict</code></article></div></section><section class="limits-section" id="limits"><div><span class="section-kicker">HONEST LIMITS</span><h2>A smoke detector, not a truth machine.</h2></div><div class="limit-copy"><p>The free engine catches structured mutations well. It can still miss subtle paraphrases, domain-specific meaning, sarcasm, or a false claim that never changes across the chain.</p><p>The runtime SDK also supports hybrid and semantic-only modes. Those modes require a host-provided model or semantic service, so their latency, cost, and variability come from that provider.</p><p>Use it to decide <em>where a human should look</em>—not to replace source verification, safety review, or compliance approval.</p><p>That is why LineageGuard reports the matching rule instead of inventing an “AI accuracy score,” and every warning remains reviewable.</p></div></section><footer><a class="brand" href="#top"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">LG</span><span>LineageGuard</span></a><nav class="footer-links" aria-label="Project links"><a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/lineageguard" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">Install SDK</a><a href="https://github.com/Mgzhnn/lineageguard" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">GitHub</a></nav><p>Open-source prototype · zero paid APIs in this browser demo · data stays local</p></footer></main><script id="_R_">import("/assets/index-fj-vBZ7x.js")</script></body></html><script>self.__VINEXT_RSC_CHUNKS__=self.__VINEXT_RSC_CHUNKS__||[];self.__VINEXT_RSC_CHUNKS__.push("2:I[\"937699ab5b37\",[],\"Children\",1]\n3:I[\"6983c9788c28\",[],\"LayoutSegmentProvider\",1]\n4:I[\"937699ab5b37\",[],\"Slot\",1]\n5:I[\"df91f3307c8c\",[],\"RedirectBoundary\",1]\n:HL[\"/assets/index-IsRZfUQe.css\",\"style\"]\n")</script><script>self.__VINEXT_RSC_CHUNKS__=self.__VINEXT_RSC_CHUNKS__||[];self.__VINEXT_RSC_CHUNKS__.push("0:{\"__route\":\"route:/\",\"__interceptionContext\":null,\"__layoutIds\":[\"layout:/\"],\"__rootLayout\":\"/\",\"page:/\":\"$L1\",\"layout:/\":[[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"css:/assets/index-IsRZfUQe.css\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"precedence\":\"vite-rsc/importer-resources\",\"href\":\"/assets/index-IsRZfUQe.css\",\"data-rsc-css-href\":\"/assets/index-IsRZfUQe.css\"}],\"$undefined\"],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{}]}]}]],null],\"route:/\":[[[\"$\",\"meta\",null,{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"LineageGuard — Watch an AI claim mutate\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"A free, local AI black-box replay that finds the first handoff where numbers, confide